### Get all pages
GET http://localhost:8080/pages
Accept: application/json

### Get pages count
GET http://localhost:8080/pages/count
Accept: application/json

### Create a page
POST http://localhost:8080/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Chính sách bảo mật",
  "slug": "chinh-sach-bao-mat",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Nội dung chính sách bảo mật..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "is_published": true,
  "meta_title": "Chính sách bảo mật - ELC",
  "meta_description": "Chính sách bảo mật của Điện máy ELC",
  "order_index": 1
}

### Get page by ID (replace placeholder)
GET http://localhost:8080/pages/PLACEHOLDER_ID
Accept: application/json

### Get page by Slug
GET http://localhost:8080/pages/slug/chinh-sach-bao-mat
Accept: application/json

### Update a page (replace placeholder)
PUT http://localhost:8080/pages/PLACEHOLDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Chính sách bảo mật updated",
  "slug": "chinh-sach-bao-mat",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": []
  },
  "is_published": true,
  "order_index": 2
}

### Delete a page (replace placeholder)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/pages/PLACEHOLDER_ID

### Restore a page (replace placeholder)
POST http://localhost:8080/pages/PLACEHOLDER_ID/restore
